  "views.lifeOfADisease.cardHeading": "What the card is telling you",
  "views.lifeOfADisease.clearIsAnswer": "<b>Clear is an answer, not a blank.</b> A dry fortnight is the ordinary result, and it is as useful to know as a warning. Open a row to see the last time that disease's weather did happen this season.",
