  "views.references.limits": "Limits",
  "views.references.limit1": "<b>No agronomy, entomology or natural history.</b> The catalogues name what is modelled or recorded around your ground; the numbers that time it stay yours.",
  "views.references.limit2": "<b>No treatment recommendations.</b> A label rate is law, and jurisdiction-specific. Event details route you to the extension service whose bulletin is authoritative where you farm.",
  "views.references.limit3": "<b>No projection dressed as a date.</b> Anything past the forecast horizon is labelled as carried forward at the recent rate, everywhere it appears.",
